**Read:** [A complete practical and academic programme](A-complete-practical-and-academic-programme.lingua#r_4XEMVM6SXP5T369FTCJ14H53YX), the complete sustained reading, course and investigation programme.

A finished broad study starts with clear explanations of charge, field, voltage, current, energy and observation, then demonstrates the full mathematical and physical progression: potential/boundary methods; electric/magnetic matter; conduction and circuit limits; induction and force; Maxwell conservation and relativity; propagation, interfaces, dispersion, guides, radiation and scattering; and the methods connecting fields to measurements and inverse claims.

Complete the substantial reading and public undergraduate/graduate work in [A complete practical and academic programme](A-complete-practical-and-academic-programme.lingua#r_4XEMVM6SXP5T369FTCJ14H53YX), reconstruct unfamiliar derivations and solve substantial problems across the breadth. Verify the three original small calculations with independent formulations and continuum/physical limits. Their success is a foundation for the reader's work, not evidence that later research or laboratory tasks have already been carried out.

Carry at least three sustained advanced studies across static/material, dynamic/wave and measurement/inverse reasoning, plus [An integrated electromagnetic-system investigation](An-integrated-electromagnetic-system-investigation.lingua#r_1FQW2ASX2WCT3JRXKKP4NB4HSN) and [Independent electromagnetic scholarship and revision](../research/Independent-electromagnetic-scholarship-and-revision.lingua#r_5TR9B1MTPCC16K9KHJ5AVEGFHM). Explain model choices, approximation domains, energy/momentum, numerical convergence, uncertainty and unresolved alternatives. Distinguish personally demonstrated physical capability from a documentary or computational reconstruction. Revisit an early everyday observation and explain it quantitatively at several scales.

This completion is intentionally demanding while keeping the subject bounded. It supports power, electronics, communications, materials, devices and scientific instruments through shared Records and ordinary references. Those connected specialist trails retain their own full depth; understanding a field law is the beginning of their engineering, fabrication and continuing work.

**Return:** [Electromagnetism — charge, fields, matter, waves and physical evidence](../Electromagnetism.lingua#r_5TJPESCTTNAKY66JH2QNQYN1PY).
